#: ../../examples/metatree_prediction_interval.ipynb:27
msgid "Installation of BayesML"
msgstr "BayesMLのインストール"

#: ../../examples/metatree_prediction_interval.ipynb:49
msgid "Load dataset"
msgstr "データセット読み込み"

#: ../../examples/metatree_prediction_interval.ipynb:260
msgid "Preprocessing"
msgstr "前処理"

#: ../../examples/metatree_prediction_interval.ipynb:301
msgid "Create model instance"
msgstr "モデルのインスタンスを作成"

#: ../../examples/metatree_prediction_interval.ipynb:303
msgid "First, calculate model constants."
msgstr "まず、モデルに必要な定数を設定します。"

#: ../../examples/metatree_prediction_interval.ipynb:337
msgid ""
"Then, create a model instance based on the model constants. For details of "
"the parameters of ``LearnModel``, please see `this page <https://"
"bayesml.github.io/BayesML/"
"bayesml.metatree.html#bayesml.metatree.LearnModel>`__."
msgstr ""
"次に、設定した定数に基づいてモデルを生成します。 ``LearnModel`` のパラメータ"
"について詳細を知りたい場合は `こちら <https://bayesml.github.io/BayesML/"
"bayesml.metatree.html#bayesml.metatree.LearnModel>`__."

#: ../../examples/metatree_prediction_interval.ipynb:375
msgid "Calculate posterior distribution"
msgstr "事後確率分布の計算"

#: ../../examples/metatree_prediction_interval.ipynb:377
msgid ""
"For details of the parameters of ``update_posterior``, please see `this "
"page <https://bayesml.github.io/BayesML/"
"bayesml.metatree.html#bayesml.metatree.LearnModel.update_posterior>`__."
msgstr ""
"各パラメータの ``update_posterior`` について詳細を知りたい場合は `こちら "
"<https://bayesml.github.io/BayesML/"
"bayesml.metatree.html#bayesml.metatree.LearnModel.update_posterior>`__."

#: ../../examples/metatree_prediction_interval.ipynb:469
msgid "Calculate prediction interval"
msgstr "予測区間の導出"

#: ../../examples/metatree_prediction_interval.ipynb:471
msgid ""
"First, define subroutines to calculate ``100(1-alpha)``\\ % prediction "
"interval from the values of the probability density function of the "
"predictive distribution."
msgstr ""
"はじめに、予測分布の確率密度関数が返す値から ``100(1-alpha)``\\ %の予測区間"
"を計算するサブルーチンを定義します。"

#: ../../examples/metatree_prediction_interval.ipynb:509
msgid ""
"Calculate the values of the probability density function of the predictive "
"distribution in the range determined by the mean and the variance of the "
"predictive distribution."
msgstr ""
"次に、予測分布の平均・分散から求まる予測区間において、予測分布の確率密度関数"
"の値を計算します。"

#: ../../examples/metatree_prediction_interval.ipynb:574
msgid "Calculate prediction interval by using the above subroutines."
msgstr "上記のサブルーチンを組み合わせて、予測区間を計算します。"

#: ../../examples/metatree_prediction_interval.ipynb:599
msgid "Evaluation"
msgstr "評価"

#: ../../examples/metatree_prediction_interval.ipynb:601
msgid "First, define subroutines for evaluation."
msgstr "まず、評価のためのサブルーチンを定義します。"

#: ../../examples/metatree_prediction_interval.ipynb:639
msgid ""
"Evaluate the results. Note that frequency close to ``100(1-alpha)``\\ % "
"(here, 0.95) and short length are desireble."
msgstr ""
"次に結果を評価します。ただし、頻度が ``100(1-alpha)``\\ %（ここでは0.95）に"
"近く、区間の長さは短い方が望ましい。"

#: ../../examples/metatree_prediction_interval.ipynb:689
msgid "Calculate prediction interval by sampling"
msgstr "サンプリングによって予測区間を導出"

#: ../../examples/metatree_prediction_interval.ipynb:691
msgid ""
"Using metatree.GenModel, prediction intervals can be calculated from a "
"sample from the posterior predictive distribution. For details of the "
"parameters of ``GenModel``, please see `this page <https://"
"bayesml.github.io/BayesML/"
"bayesml.metatree.html#bayesml.metatree.GenModel>`__."
msgstr ""
"metatree.GenModelを使用すれば、事後確率分布からサンプリングしたサンプルを用"
"いて予測区間を導出できます。この ``GenModel`` のパラメータについて、詳細は `"
"こちら <https://bayesml.github.io/BayesML/"
"bayesml.metatree.html#bayesml.metatree.GenModel>`__."

